 * Name: esp32s3_spi_dma_exchange
 *
 * Description:
 *   Exchange a block of data from SPI by DMA.
 *
 * Input Parameters:
 *   priv     - SPI private state data
 *   txbuffer - A pointer to the buffer of data to be sent
